            "action_name": {
              "value": "Staggering Sail"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation)\n\nRequirements: The spinosaurus is swimming on the surface of water\n\nWith a powerful lunge to the side, the spinosaurus uses its sail to slap the surface of the water, creating a crushing wave of water that deals 6d6 bludgeoning damage in a 30-foot cone. Each creature in the water in the area must attempt a 30 Reflex save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is slowed 1 until the end of its next turn.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and is stunned 3."
            },
